config SECURITY_TRUSTCORE_NET
	bool "Trustcore network socket gating"
	depends on SECURITY && SECURITY_NETWORK && TRUSTCORE_NET
	default n
	help
	  This enables the Trustcore network LSM, which restricts socket
	  creation to AF_INET/AF_INET6 TCP and UDP while allowing AF_UNIX
	  and AF_VSOCK. All other socket types and families are denied.

	  If you are unsure how to answer this question, answer N.
